sibi meritis beati Benedicti fecerit Dominus.</P> <P COM="0509">14. Huic porro <NOTE N="565" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4.</NOTE>  abbati praefatus <NOTE N="566" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> praedictus Arichis princeps 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  princeps
Arichis concessit partes majores in territorio Gentianae
