est</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> . 2. quem—effectus  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  Carolo obsidem datum praediximus <NOTE N="568" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> praemisimus 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE> ,
 <COL N="0510A"></COL> ejusdem regis concessione post patris
obitum Beneventum remissus et princeps effectus,
per praeceptum donationis concessit ( <HI REND="ITALIC">an. 788. Sept.</HI> )
beato <NOTE N="569" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> sancto 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  Benedicto universa domnicalia sua cum
servis et ancillis in eodem territorio Gentianae; et
cellam sancti Agapiti; portum quoque Trajectensem
