 <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  lacus vocabulo
Adrestina. Insuper <NOTE N="577" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Sed 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  et gualdum <NOTE N="(323)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0510" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0510C"></COL> Nemus, quod alibi foresta dicebatur.</NOTE>  suum
