Wacco <NOTE N="579" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Guacco  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  Wacco 1 <SUP>b</SUP> . Vacco
4.</NOTE>  nomine Beneventanus gastaldeus in expeditione
constitutus <NOTE N="580" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  obtulit <NOTE N="(324)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0510" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0510C"></COL> Hujus oblationis charta non exstat.</NOTE>  in hoc sancto
