cum rebus inferius designatis. Casalem <NOTE N="583" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> casale  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  aliud  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed. semper.</HI></NOTE>  in Trane
ubi dicitur Cimilianum; casalem in Trepurio; casalem
