cum oliveto; alium in Culmo; alium in Genne;
alium in Monte nigro; in <NOTE N="585" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> et in M. et ad R. et in N. et in C. 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  Massa; ad Ripam; in
 <COL N="0510C"></COL> Noceto <NOTE N="586" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Nocetum  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  Noceto 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> ; in Corneto; in Tammaro <NOTE N="587" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Tamaro
1 <SUP>b</SUP> . 2.</NOTE> ; in Latiniano;
in Marsico; in Trelicio <NOTE N="588" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Trelitio 3.</NOTE> ; in finibus Potentiae,
et casalem in Sancta Agnete. Casam vero
suam intra civitatem judicavit Tasie uxori sue, in
vita dumtaxat ipsius. Servos autem suos et ancillas
omnes libertati donavit, sub dicione tamen et tutela
monasterii hujus; ita ut per singulos singulas operas
annualiter ubicumque <NOTE N="589" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> ubi 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  nostri ordinati praeciperent
exercerent.</P> <P COM="0510"><COL N="0511A"></COL> 15. Hujus abbatis <NOTE N="590" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest 1. ed.</HI></NOTE>  tempore Paulus diaconus
supradicti <NOTE N="591" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> . praedicti 1.</NOTE>  regis Desiderii notarius <NOTE N="592" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> atque consiliarius  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1.</NOTE> , post captionem
ejusdem <NOTE N="593" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> ipsius 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  Desiderii, et Arichis Beneventani
principis obitum, ad hoc monasterium venit,
et sanctae sibi <NOTE N="594" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> ibi 3.</NOTE>  religionis habitum induit. Quis
autem vel qualis, vel unde domo <NOTE N="595" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> domnus 2.</NOTE>  Paulus hic fuerit,
non est ab re perstringere.  <CITN>[P. D. IV, 37.]</CITN>  Iste
siquidem ex Langobardorum gente originem duxit;
ejus namque abavus Leupichis nomine, eo tempore
quo primum in Italiam Langobardi ingressi sunt,
cum eis venit. Cujus Pauli pater nomine Warnefrid <NOTE N="596" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> Varn. 4.</NOTE> ,
mater Theodelinda <NOTE N="597" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> Teodelenda 3.</NOTE>  fuit.  <CITN>[Chr. Sal. 9.]</CITN> 
Qui a puero disciplinis liberalibus eruditus, maximum
in curia Desiderii regis ob suam industriam
familiaritatis locum obtinuit, atque Aquileiensis
 <COL N="0511B"></COL> patriarchii diaconus extitit. Hic post captam ut supra
diximus Papiam, cum regi quoque Karolo <NOTE N="598" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> carolo  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  karolo 1.</NOTE> 
pro sua prudentia admodum carus et <NOTE N="599" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> ac 4.</NOTE>  familiaris
effectus <NOTE N="600" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> esset
 <HI REND="ITALIC">add. 1 <SUP>b</SUP> . ed.</HI></NOTE> , ac non multo post eidem <NOTE N="601" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> p. accusatus e. r. fuisset a q. invidis, q. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  regi a quibusdam
invidis accusatus fuisset, quod eum propter
fidelitatem Desiderii domini sui voluisset <NOTE N="602" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> vellet 1.</NOTE>  occidere,
fecit eum idem rex in <NOTE N="603" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> r. comprehendi et coram
se a. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  praesentiam suam
adduci. Quem cum interrogasset utrum vera essent
ea <NOTE N="604" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> essent quae super morte sua de eo dicerentur, r. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI>  e. et unde i. s. occasione
s. 4.</NOTE>  unde ipse super occisione sua accusaretur?
constanter respondit se pro certo fidelissimum domini
sui semper <NOTE N="605" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4.</NOTE>  fuisse, et in eadem se fidelitate
cum vita perseverare. Ad haec rex <NOTE N="606" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> r. s.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  4.</NOTE>  subito ira
succensus, praecepit eum manibus sine mora privari;
moxque <NOTE N="607" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> p. sed mox 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  in se reversus, et reminiscens
magnae <NOTE N="608" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> r. sagacitatis ejus atque prudentiae, s. 1. 2.</NOTE>  nimis illius scientiae, suspirans ait:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Et si
 <COL N="0511C"></COL> manus</HI> <NOTE N="609" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> e. m. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ejus abscidimus, ubi jam</HI> <NOTE N="605" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">tam elegantem
scriptorem reperiemus?</HI>  et ait proceribus assistentibus
sibi:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dicite, quid super hoc vobis videtur?</HI>  At
illi:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Digne</HI> <NOTE N="610" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> illi: ut eruantur inquiunt ejus oculi, ne 1. illi: Jubete inq. ut er. ejus oc. ne 2.</NOTE>  inquiunt  <HI REND="ITALIC">tanto viro compateris o rex;
sed ne aliquando aliquas alicui contra vos litteras dirigat,
jubete</HI> <NOTE N="611" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> d.
Et ubi vel q. ait rex t. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI>  vel q.  <HI REND="ITALIC">superscr.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">si placet ut eruantur oculi ejus. Et ubi</HI> 
ait rex  <HI REND="ITALIC">vel quando tam insignem hystoriographum
aut poetam invenire valebimus?</HI>  Illi vero considerantes
 <NOTE N="612" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> v. videntes c. i. regis compassionem ac ben. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  circa illum benigni regis benivolentiam, suaserunt
tandem <NOTE N="613" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  ut in Diomedis <NOTE N="(325)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511C"></COL> Nomen Leo addidit.</NOTE>  insula quae
hodie a tribus montibus Tremiti nuncupatur <NOTE N="614" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> dicitur 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE> 
 <COL N="0512A"></COL> eum exiliaret; factumque est. Ubi eum per aliquot
annos exul <NOTE N="615" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> religatus 1. exulatus  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  mansisset, homunculus quidam
qui <NOTE N="616" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> q. ei  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  4.</NOTE>  ei propter Deum praebebat <NOTE N="617" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> D. obs. faciebat, c. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  obsequium
clam illum de ipsa insula expulit, et cum eo pariter
Beneventum perrexit. Quo viso Arichis qui filiam
praefati Desiderii domini <NOTE N="618" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> D. regis A. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  ipsius Adelbergam nomine
habebat <NOTE N="619" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> u. h. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  uxorem, valde tam ipse quam
et <NOTE N="620" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4.</NOTE>  eadem ejus conjunx <NOTE N="621" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> conjux  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  conjunx, 1 conjux  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  gavisi sunt; eumque
secum <NOTE N="622" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> in palatio  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  2.
in p. quandiu Arichis vixit  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1.</NOTE>  honorifice <NOTE N="623" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> honorificentissime 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  retinuerunt. Quo videlicet
tempore, utrumque palatium quae idem princeps
unum in Benevento, alterum in Salerno nobiliter
construxerat <NOTE N="624" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> construxit 1.</NOTE> , idem <NOTE N="625" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> praefatus 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  Paulus versibus luculentissimis
exornavit. In <NOTE N="626" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> Ejusdem etiam A. rog. in h. R. q. E. b. c. plurima 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  historia etiam Romana
quam Eutropius breviter composuerat, ejusdem
Adelpergae rogatu plurima hinc inde ex <NOTE N="627" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> de 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  historiis
 <COL N="0512B"></COL> ecclesiasticis addidit  <CITN>[cf. Chr. S. Ben. p. 201]</CITN> . Ad
ultimum vero duos libellos a tempore Juliani apostate
in quem ipsam hystoriam <NOTE N="628" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> q. sua t.  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  Eutropius terminaverat,
usque ad tempora primi Justiniani imperatoris
eidem annexuit. Necnon <NOTE N="629" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> Necnon-composuit
 <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  et universas fere
annalis computi lectiunculas rithmice composuit.
 <CITN>[Chr. Sal. 36, 37.]</CITN>  Defuncto autem Arichis mox ad
hoc monasterium ut supra diximus properavit; et
factus monachus, non parvo hic <NOTE N="630" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> pauco 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI>  p. ibi 1. 2.</NOTE>  tempore vixit.
Rogatusque a praedicto abbate vel fratribus, expositionem
super regulam sancti Benedicti <NOTE N="631" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> simplicibus fratribus  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1.</NOTE>  valde
utilissimam edidit, ubi multa de veteri hujus loci
consuetudine necessaria attestatur <NOTE N="632" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> testatur  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>   <NOTE N="(326)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511C"></COL> Exstat in cod. Casin. 353 expositio hujusmodi,
quam Paulo nostro vindicare novissime studuit
V. C. Tosti,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hist. Cas.</HI>  I. p. 99 ss.</NOTE> . Historiam
 <NOTE N="633" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> Historiam—et  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  1. 2.</NOTE>  quoque gentis suae id est Langobardorum,
et nonnulla <NOTE N="634" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> etiam  <HI REND="ITALIC">add. 1. ei.</HI></NOTE>  alia scripta eleganti stilo composuit.
 <COL N="0512C"></COL> Inter quae versus quoque reciprocos, elegiaco <NOTE N="635" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> rec. et hymnum 1. r. et hymnos  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE> 
metro digestos et hymnum de singulis beati Benedicti
miraculis, satis diserto sermone conscripsit.</P> <P COM="0512">Ad hunc praefatus Carolus <NOTE N="636" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> rex
ux  <HI REND="ITALIC">add. 1. ed.</HI></NOTE>  qui eum exiliari
jusserat, audito quod in hoc loco monachicum habitum
assumpsisset, plurimum illi congratulans,
satis affabiles et jocundas litteras metrice compositas
misit <NOTE N="(327)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511C"></COL> Integras habet codex noster 257.  <ED>ANG.</ED>  Ex
 <COL N="0512C"></COL> quo ediderunt Tosti  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hist. Cas.</HI>  I, 105; Giesebrecht
 <HI REND="ITALIC">De litt. studiis ap. Italos;</HI>  Berol. 1845, 4 <SUP>o</SUP> . p. 26.
Sed ne in his quidem versibus a mutandis verbis
Leo abstinuit.</NOTE> ; de quibus aliquot hic versus inserere
libuit. Ait enim, post aliquanta cartulam <NOTE N="637" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> cartom 1. cartulam 1 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> 
suam alloquens, ita <NOTE N="638" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">dest 1. ed.</HI></NOTE> :

 <POEM COM="0512"><L><HI REND="ITALIC">Hinc</HI> <NOTE N="639" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> i. a. Roma  <HI REND="ITALIC">hyprascr.</HI>  1. a.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">celer egrediens facili mea carta volatu,</HI></L> <L><COL N="0513A"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Per silvas, colles, valles quoque praepete</HI> <NOTE N="640" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> perpete 2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">cursu,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Alma Deo cari Benedicti tecta require.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Est nam certa quies fessis venientibus illuc.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Hic holus hospitibus, piscis</HI> <NOTE N="641" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> pisces 1.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">hic panis abundat,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Pax pia, mens humilis, pulchra et concordia fratrum,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Laus, honor</HI> <NOTE N="642" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> amor 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed. cod.</HI>  257.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et cultus Christi simul omnibus horis.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Dic</HI> <NOTE N="643" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> hic pater et 4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">patri et sociis cunctis, salvete, valete.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Colla mei Pauli gaudendo amplectere</HI> <NOTE N="644" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> amplecte benigne, Dicito
1. 2.  <HI REND="ITALIC">cod. 257. (ubi</HI>  colla-benigne  <HI REND="ITALIC">recenti manu addita sunt.</HI> )</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">dulcis,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Dicens multotiens, salve pater optime, salve.</HI></L></POEM> 

Et <NOTE N="645" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> et r.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  4.</NOTE>  reliqua.</P> <P COM="0513">Cui similiter idem Paulus versifice rescribere,
et gratias pro visitatione et salutatione sua cunctorumque
fratrum referre maximas studuit <NOTE N="(328)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513C"></COL> Metrica Pauli responsio apud nos non exstat.
 <ED>ANG.</ED></NOTE> .
 <CITN>[Chr. Sal 37.]</CITN>  Jam vero aetate maturus, vitae hujus
cursus explevit <NOTE N="(329)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513C"></COL> Necrologium Casinense cod. 47 sic habet:
