domno Paschali papae transmisit. Hoc <NOTE N="652" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> Hoc—loci  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  tempore
