 <HI REND="ITALIC">postea alio atramento adscripsit.</HI></NOTE>  Herchemperti refertur <NOTE N="(352)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0519" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0519C"></COL> Ultima verba postea addidit, cum rem
