juxta gradus porticus qua tunc <NOTE N="774" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0519" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0519"></COL> tunc  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> . temp.  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4.</NOTE>  temporis pergebatur
ad ecclesiam sancti Martini.</P> <P COM="0520">DEUSDEDIT quintus decimus abbas sedit annis
