 <NOTE N="803" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0521" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0521"></COL> o. d.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> . 2.</NOTE>  divina Beneventum translatum est <NOTE N="(364*)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0521" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0521C"></COL> A. D. 838, mense Aug., sed ecclesia perfecta
