Gontarius <NOTE N="(365)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0522" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0522C"></COL> Reg. n. 299.  <ED>ANG.</ED></NOTE>  abbas monasterii sancti Modesti
reddidit beato <NOTE N="806" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0521" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0521"></COL> r. huic dudum 4.  <HI REND="ITALIC">integro ut videtur versu omisso.</HI></NOTE>  Benedicto res quas dudum <NOTE N="807" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0521" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0521"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest 1 <SUP>b</SUP> . ed.</HI></NOTE> 
Authpertus abbas per scriptum convenientie concesserat
