 <NOTE N="809" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0521" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0521"></COL> c. in C.  <HI REND="ITALIC">om.</HI>  4.</NOTE>  in Campi; curtem in Pastena; et casam unam
