Ahgen. 1 <SUP>b</SUP> . Hagenardus 4. Aienardus, Agenardus  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  Achenardus  <HI REND="ITALIC">in ipso dipl.</HI></NOTE>   <NOTE N="(366)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0522" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0522C"></COL> Gatt. Acc. pag. 36, ann. 10 Sikenolfi, ind.
