cum servis et ancillis, et universis quae sibi jure
haereditario competebant. Sed et Arnefrid <NOTE N="(368)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0522" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0522C"></COL> Reg., n. 308.  <ED>ANG.</ED></NOTE> 
quidam nobilis Aliphanus <NOTE N="812" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0521" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0521"></COL> Alifanus 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  obtulit beato Benedicto
