 <COL N="0523A"></COL> id est curte una in Telesia <NOTE N="816" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0523" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0523"></COL> Telese 1*.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE> , vocabulo Pulianellum
 <NOTE N="817" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0523" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0523"></COL> Pulianellu 1*. 2.</NOTE> , et altera <NOTE N="818" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0523" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0523"></COL> alia 1*.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  in Aliphis <NOTE N="819" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0523" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0523"></COL> Alife 1*.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  in qua est constructa
