divisus est. Cur autem vel qualiter divisus sit, et
qua occasione primum <NOTE N="831" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0523" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0523"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 2.</NOTE>  Saraceni ab his invitati
