 <COL N="0525A"></COL> calicibus et patenis, coronis, ac crucibus, fialis <NOTE N="859" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0525" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0525"></COL> phialis 4.</NOTE> 
quoque et amulis, bokis <NOTE N="860" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0525" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0525"></COL> boris 3. bolcis 4.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(378)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0525" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0525C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Al.</HI>  bauca, vasis species; unde Ital.  <HI REND="ITALIC">boccale,</HI> 
