Grimoaldus <NOTE N="862" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0525" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0525"></COL> Grimoald. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE> , scriptum redditionis monasterio
isti <NOTE N="863" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0525" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0525"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4.</NOTE>  fecerunt. Item <NOTE N="864" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0525" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0525"></COL> Item—inauratum
 <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  secundo, trecentas sexaginta
