placuit appellata.</P> <P COM="0541">Hic idem christianissimus imperator circa <NOTE N="1181" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0541" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0541"></COL> c. h. t.  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP>  i. Ludowicus c. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE> 
