 <COL N="0565B"></COL> <NOTE N="1650" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0565" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0565"></COL> ipse  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  abbas fecit libellum cuidam Grimoaldo de
Camerino de cunctis <NOTE N="1651" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0565" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0565"></COL> omnibus  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  rebus hujus monasterii
quae sunt in pertinentia Termulensi, intra Bifernum
