 <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1, 2.</NOTE>  quintus <NOTE N="1654" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0565" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0565"></COL> vic. quintus 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  et vicesimus
a beato Benedicto ( <HI REND="ITALIC">an.</HI>  942). Fuit <NOTE N="1655" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0565" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0565"></COL> Fuit—ejus Landulfi  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  temporibus
