atque in Teutonicam terram transmissis exilio;
moxque Adelaidis <NOTE N="1809" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0573" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0573"></COL> Adhelaidis 1 <SUP>b</SUP> . 2.</NOTE>  conjugium Otto sortitus, Teutonicis
