idem episcopus ante sex circiter <NOTE N="1960" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0585" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0585"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4.</NOTE>  annos sua
