 <COL N="0589B"></COL> Sed et Borrellus comes de Petra abundanti <NOTE N="2000" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0589" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0589"></COL> habundanti 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(593)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0589" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0589C"></COL> In Abrutio cit. territ. Triventi.</NOTE> 
fecit huic <NOTE N="2001" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0589" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0589"></COL> in hoc m. cartam 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  monasterio cartulam oblationis de
