in territorio Aquinensi, loco qui Publica vocatur,
plana utique <NOTE N="2005" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0589" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0589"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4.</NOTE>  et montana perplurima. Hildebrandus
