devotissimus obtulit, ipsa <NOTE N="2158" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> et in argenteo
loculo venerabiliter collocatam 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">del.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  die <NOTE N="2159" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> d. N. N.  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  Nonarum
Novembrium. Depositus <NOTE N="2160" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">haec in fine c. 8. habet</HI>  1.</NOTE>  est autem praedictus
abbas 9. Kal. Decembris <NOTE N="(612)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597B"></COL> In cod. 47,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Nono Kal. Decembris Aligernus
sacerdos et abbas hujus loci.</HI>  In codice 353 habetur
epitaphium Aligerni, manu s. XI. scriptum, quod
per Bethmannum V. D. denuo collatum hic subnectimus:

 <POEM COM="0597"><L><HI REND="ITALIC">Hic pater egregius Aligernus pausat humatus</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Pignere vivifico resiliturus item.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Nativa bonitate cluens</HI> <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597B"></COL> summus  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit c.</HI></NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et inclitus orbi,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Urbe Neapoleos satus et altus erat.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Ast Domini praecepta librans, patriam quoque linquens,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Quo caput orbis habet, pervolitabat ovans:</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Aecclesiae doctoris enim delegit asilum,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Sub patre Balthwino subdere colla Deo.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Dogmate normali virtutum culmina postquam</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Attigit, hoc sacrum regere gimnasium</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Promeruit, quo cuncta micant spiramina lucis,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Per mare, per terras, per juga, perque chaos.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Quod quia frustratum fuerat tum</HI> <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597B"></COL> tam  <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">temporis, ille</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Nisibus omnigenis enceniarat hians.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Tigna novans tegulasque locans dissepta resarsit,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Picturamque—rudem—fecit habere domum.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Quid valeat, quid non, quo virtus, quo ferat error,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Noverat ipse sagax propositique tenax.</HI></L> <L><COL N="0598B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Non persona potens fuerat, quae tempneret illum,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Quae placeantque rogat, quo dare cuncta queat.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Gravis erat moribus, monachorum specula exstans,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Cuncta gerens placido ingenioque pio.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Jam meritis pater ille pius talibusque refertus,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Laetus ab aethereis sumitur ecce choris.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Conditur his septis ter ternis rite Kalendis</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Romulei mensis, ipse December adest.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Hoc pie coenobium ter denos rexerat annos,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Septenosque simul, sic adiitque</HI> <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597B"></COL> adiique  <HI REND="ITALIC">cod.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">plum.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Nunc monachile decus titulum cum legeris istum,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Dic, et in aeternum nunc habeat requiem. Amen.</HI></L></POEM> 

Ind. XIV obiisse produnt Ann. Cas. ut annum 37
minime compleverit.</NOTE>  ( <HI REND="ITALIC">an.</HI>  985), et honorifice
 <NOTE N="2152" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0595" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0595"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4.</NOTE>  sepultus juxta ecclesiam sancti Benedicti.</P> <P COM="0597">MANSO abbas <NOTE N="2161" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> M.
28. a. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  vicesimus octavus, sedit annis
undecim.</P> <P COM="0597">12. Iste fuit consobrinus Pandulfi principis <NOTE N="(613)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0598" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0598B"></COL> Laidolfus etiam princeps consanguineum
suum appellat in suo praecepto, in Regesto Petri
num. 235.  <ED>ANG.</ED></NOTE> ;
qui cum eo tempore quo Aligernus <NOTE N="2162" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> Aliernus 3.</NOTE>  abbas defunctus
 <COL N="0597B"></COL> est, monasterio sancti Magni juxta Fundanam
civitatem <NOTE N="(614)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0598" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0598B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Fondi.</HI></NOTE>  posito praeesset, propinquorum
principum solacio <NOTE N="2163" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> f. s. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  fretus, non autem <NOTE N="2164" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> a. omnium hujus loci m. c. 1. 2.</NOTE>  monachorum
consensu, coenobii hujus abbatiam indeptus
est. Unde factum est, ut nonnulli de prioribus ac
 <NOTE N="2165" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> et m. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  2.</NOTE>  melioribus hujus monasterii fratribus potius
hinc egredi quam manere sub illo eligerent. E quibus
domnus <NOTE N="2166" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 2.</NOTE>  Johannes Beneventanus qui postmodum
abbas extitit, unus fuit: alter vero domnus <NOTE N="2167" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1, 2.</NOTE> 
Theobaldus, nichilominus postmodum abbas effectus
 <COL N="0598A"></COL> domnus etiam Liutius, de religiosioribus <NOTE N="2168" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> religiosis hujus l. m. ac prioribus u. 1  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE> 
ac prioribus loci hujus monachis unus; nec non et
quinque alii quorum nomina non recoluntur. Et <NOTE N="2169" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> E ( <HI REND="ITALIC">deest ed.</HI> ) quibus omnibus
tres priores I, p. s. Quinque v. alii in L. 1  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE> 
tres quidem primi Jerusolimam profecti sunt; ceteri
vero quinque in Lambardiam: quos cum ob maximam
hujus loci devotionem Hugo marchio nimis
honorifice <NOTE N="2170" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> reverenter 1  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  suscepisset, ex ejus largitione quinque
 <NOTE N="2171" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> l. atque concessione q. monasteria
in i. p. c. ibique i. t. h. m. o. o. p. 1  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  in illis partibus coenobia construxerunt,
atque juxta hujus monasterii traditionem omnem
ibi ordinem posuerunt. Ex <NOTE N="2172" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> Ex—habentur  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  1. Ex cujus etiam m.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  hujus marchionis dono
duo hic argentae coronae habentur.</P> <P COM="0598">13. Per <NOTE N="2173" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">totam
cap. add.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP></NOTE>  idem tempus supradictus Otto tertius
interventu matris <NOTE N="2174" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> m. suae a. 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  augustae Theophanu <NOTE N="2175" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0597" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0597"></COL> Theophanii  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  praeceptum
huic monasterio fecit ( <HI REND="ITALIC">an. 989 Jul.</HI>  23),
