Benedicti VIII, anno 3, ind. IX (13?).</NOTE> . Ecclesia quoque sancti Angeli in territorio
de Ceperano, loco qui dicitur Cannuzzu <NOTE N="2556" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> Canuzzu 2. Cannuzo 3. Cannuzu 4. cum omnibus pertinentiis et finibus
suis  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  a Landuino
et Raterio <NOTE N="2557" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> Racterio 2. Ratherio 3.</NOTE>  consulibus Campanie <NOTE N="(681)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0620" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0620C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">De civitate Berulana</HI>  inquit chartula eorum
num. 273.  <ED>ANG.</ED></NOTE> .
Sed et Saphirus quidam <NOTE N="2558" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  4.</NOTE>  presbyter obtulit huic
monasterio ecclesiam sancti <NOTE N="2559" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> e. juris sui vocabulo S. Benedictus
1 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">ea.</HI></NOTE>  Benedicti apud Capitinatam
civitate Murrone, cum omnibus <NOTE N="2560" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> o. rebus et pertinentiis s. 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  suis.
