 <COL N="0620B"></COL> et Sancti Apollinaris in eodem Murrone <NOTE N="2563" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> Morrone 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> , loco vocabulo
