nec non et monasterium sancti Benedicti <NOTE N="(682)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0620" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0620C"></COL> Postea dictum  <HI REND="ITALIC">de jumento albo.</HI>  Exstat in
