rebus suis  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed. Sequuntur Rainerius, Albo (Adelpertus, Lupus), Stephanus</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  etiam sancti
