in Betuge <NOTE N="2580" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0621" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0621"></COL> Betuie 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  et sancti Magni in Castuli, cum omnibus
earum pertinentiis atque rebus <NOTE N="*" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0621" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0621C"></COL> Leo quoque presbyter et monachus de territorio
