cum omnibus pertinentiis ejus. Tunc <NOTE N="2585" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0621" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0621"></COL> Per idem tempus praedictus  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed.</HI></NOTE>  temporis
( <HI REND="ITALIC">an. 1012 Jun.</HI> ) praefatus <NOTE N="(683)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0621" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0621C"></COL> C. 26 Charta exstat ap. Gatt. H., p. 327, ubi
