post III
car  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="1730621A" TEXT="[Character]"></ORNAMENT>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sed nihil inveni, nisi quae c. 26. leguntur de Lupo filio Azzonis. Inde 1. pergit:</HI>  Hic abbas  <HI REND="ITALIC">v. init. cap.</HI></NOTE> . Adelpertus <NOTE N="(686)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0621" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0621C"></COL> Ib., pag. 109, a. D. 1021, mens. Nov.,
 <COL N="0622C"></COL> ind. III</NOTE>  etiam
