quinque milibus modiis terrae.</P> <P COM="0621"><COL N="0621C"></COL> 33. Eodem <NOTE N="2598" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0621" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0621"></COL> His diebus 1.
